This patch adapts Go 1.27.1 src/fmt/scan.go under the retained Go BSD license.
The source header and package license remain in the patched output.

Nested scanners traverse their wrapper chain without recursive Dart calls.
A custom scanner yields before recursion to preserve the fixed Dart stack.

--- a/scan.go
+++ b/scan.go
